@startuml
title Kubernetes Pod Communication with MAC Addresses

skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor #333333
  ActorBorderColor #333333
  LifeLineBorderColor #666666
  LifeLineBackgroundColor #F5F5F5
  ParticipantBorderColor #333333
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  ParticipantFontSize 12
}

' Define participants with network interfaces and MAC addresses
participant "Pod A" as PodA
participant "Pod A net1\n2.1.0.10/24\nMAC: 02:00:00:00:00:0B" as PodA_net1
participant "Pod A net2\n2.1.1.10/24\nMAC: 02:00:00:00:00:0C" as PodA_net2
participant "VLAN 2000 Bridge\nMAC: 00:1A:2B:3C:4D:50" as VLAN2000
participant "VLAN 2001 Bridge\nMAC: 00:1A:2B:3C:4D:51" as VLAN2001
participant "Pod B net1\n2.1.0.11/24\nMAC: 02:00:00:00:00:0E" as PodB_net1
participant "Pod B net2\n2.1.1.11/24\nMAC: 02:00:00:00:00:0F" as PodB_net2
participant "Pod B" as PodB

' Communication via VLAN 2000 (net1 interfaces)
note over PodA, VLAN2000: <b>VLAN 2000 Communication</b>\nSubnet: 2.1.0.0/24
PodA -> PodA_net1 : 1. Send to 2.1.0.11\nSrc MAC: 02:00:00:00:00:0B
PodA_net1 -> VLAN2000 : 2. Forward via net1
VLAN2000 -> PodB_net1 : 3. Deliver to Pod B net1\nDst MAC: 02:00:00:00:00:0E
PodB_net1 -> PodB : 4. Receive packet

PodB -> PodB_net1 : 5. Reply to 2.1.0.10\nSrc MAC: 02:00:00:00:00:0E
PodB_net1 -> VLAN2000 : 6. Forward via net1
VLAN2000 -> PodA_net1 : 7. Deliver to Pod A net1\nDst MAC: 02:00:00:00:00:0B
PodA_net1 -> PodA : 8. Receive reply
note over PodA, PodB: <b>VLAN 2000 complete</b>

' Communication via VLAN 2001 (net2 interfaces)
note over PodA, VLAN2001: <b>VLAN 2001 Communication</b>\nSubnet: 2.1.1.0/24
PodA -> PodA_net2 : 9. Send to 2.1.1.11\nSrc MAC: 02:00:00:00:00:0C
PodA_net2 -> VLAN2001 : 10. Forward via net2
VLAN2001 -> PodB_net2 : 11. Deliver to Pod B net2\nDst MAC: 02:00:00:00:00:0F
PodB_net2 -> PodB : 12. Receive packet

PodB -> PodB_net2 : 13. Reply to 2.1.1.10\nSrc MAC: 02:00:00:00:00:0F
PodB_net2 -> VLAN2001 : 14. Forward via net2
VLAN2001 -> PodA_net2 : 15. Deliver to Pod A net2\nDst MAC: 02:00:00:00:00:0C
PodA_net2 -> PodA : 16. Receive reply
note over PodA, PodB: <b>VLAN 2001 complete</b>

' Summary
note over PodA, PodB
<b>Summary:</b>
- Pod A net1: 2.1.0.10/24, MAC: 02:00:00:00:00:0B
- Pod A net2: 2.1.1.10/24, MAC: 02:00:00:00:00:0C
- Pod B net1: 2.1.0.11/24, MAC: 02:00:00:00:00:0E
- Pod B net2: 2.1.1.11/24, MAC: 02:00:00:00:00:0F
- VLAN Bridges: 00:1A:2B:3C:4D:50/51
- Each VLAN is isolated at Layer 2
end note

@enduml
